#   - Improve inner-loop efficiency and expose ILP/SIMD opportunities
#   - Keep the triangular data dependencies in k intact
# Strategy:
#   - For each of the three inner loops over i (sum, z-update, y-copy):
#       * Strip-mine i with a small constant factor (4)
#       * Unroll the inner strip loop
#   - Finally, run a simplification pass to clean up the generated code.

